#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_no_below_cost
msgid ""
"A price or a discount that sells a product for less than its cost is "
"refused."
msgstr "低于成本销售产品的价格或折扣将被拒绝。"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_no_close
msgid ""
"Close Register is hidden from the menu of the Point of Sale, and closing "
"sent anyway is refused."
msgstr "“关闭收银机”将从销售点菜单中隐藏，强行发送的关闭将被拒绝。"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_pos_access_hr
msgid ""
"Completely free. Sets the Point of Sale restrictions on each employee who "
"logs in to the shop: an employee with rules of their own follows them, the "
"others follow their Odoo user, or else the Odoo user who opened the shop."
msgstr ""
"完全免费。为每位登录店铺的员工设置销售点限制：有自己规则的员工遵循其规则，其他员工遵循其 Odoo 用户，否则遵循打开店铺的 Odoo 用户。"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_no_partner_edit
msgid ""
"Create and Edit are hidden from the customers of the Point of Sale, and "
"saving a customer from it is refused. Choosing a customer stays possible."
msgstr "销售点客户中的“创建”和“编辑”被隐藏，从中保存客户将被拒绝。仍可选择客户。"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_pos_access_hr.hr_employee_view_form_pos_access
msgid "Customers and Lines"
msgstr "客户与明细行"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_pos_access_hr.hr_employee_view_form_pos_access
msgid "Discounts and Prices"
msgstr "折扣与价格"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__display_name
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access_hr.field_om_pos_access__display_name
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access_hr.field_pos_order__display_name
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access_hr.field_pos_session__display_name
msgid "Display Name"
msgstr "显示名称"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model,name:om_pos_access_hr.model_hr_employee
msgid "Employee"
msgstr "员工"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_pos_access_hr.hr_employee_view_form_pos_access
msgid "Every payment method of the shop"
msgstr "店铺的所有付款方式"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_om_pos_access_hr
msgid ""
"The Point of Sale restrictions of POS Access Control, for the employees who "
"log in to the shop with a badge or a PIN"
msgstr "POS 访问控制的销售点限制，适用于使用工牌或 PIN 登录店铺的员工"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_max_price_cut
msgid ""
"How far below the price of the pricelist a price may be set. 0 for no limit."
msgstr "价格可低于价目表价格的幅度。0 表示不限。"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access_hr.field_om_pos_access__id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access_hr.field_pos_order__id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access_hr.field_pos_session__id
msgid "ID"
msgstr "ID"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_payment_method_ids
msgid ""
"Leave empty to allow every payment method of the shop. Set, only these are "
"shown and may be used, and orders paid otherwise are refused."
msgstr "留空则允许店铺的所有付款方式。设置后只显示并可使用这些方式，以其他方式付款的订单将被拒绝。"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_max_discount
msgid "Maximum Discount (%)"
msgstr "最大折扣 (%)"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_max_price_cut
msgid "Maximum Price Cut (%)"
msgstr "最大降价 (%)"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_no_below_cost
msgid "Never Below Cost"
msgstr "绝不低于成本"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_no_cash_move
msgid "No Cash In or Out"
msgstr "禁止现金存取"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_no_close
msgid "No Closing the Register"
msgstr "禁止关闭收银机"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_no_partner_edit
msgid "No Creating or Editing Customers"
msgstr "禁止创建或编辑客户"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_no_discount
msgid "No Discounts"
msgstr "禁止折扣"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_no_price_change
msgid "No Price Changes"
msgstr "禁止改价"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_no_refund
msgid "No Refunds"
msgstr "禁止退款"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_no_decrease
msgid "No Removing Lines or Lowering Quantities"
msgstr "禁止删除明细行或减少数量"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_pos_access_hr.hr_employee_view_form_pos_access
msgid ""
"Off: they follow the rules of their Odoo user, or else of the Odoo user who "
"opened the shop."
msgstr "关闭：遵循其 Odoo 用户的规则，否则遵循打开店铺的 Odoo 用户的规则。"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_no_decrease
msgid ""
"Once a product is on the order, it cannot be removed nor its quantity "
"lowered: a manager has to. Checked on the screen of the Point of Sale only: "
"the server only sees the final order."
msgstr "产品一旦加入订单，就不能删除或减少数量：须由经理操作。仅在销售点屏幕上检查：服务器只看到最终订单。"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_payment_method_ids
msgid "Only These Payment Methods"
msgstr "仅限这些付款方式"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_pos_access_hr.hr_employee_view_form_pos_access
msgid "Orders"
msgstr "订单"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_own_rules
msgid "Own Point of Sale Rules"
msgstr "自有销售点规则"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_om_pos_access_hr
msgid "POS Access Control for Employees"
msgstr "员工 POS 访问控制"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_pos_access_hr.hr_employee_view_form_pos_access
msgid "Point of Sale"
msgstr "销售点"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model,name:om_pos_access_hr.model_om_pos_access
msgid "Point of Sale Access Control"
msgstr "销售点访问控制"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model,name:om_pos_access_hr.model_pos_order
msgid "Point of Sale Order"
msgstr "销售点订单"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model,name:om_pos_access_hr.model_pos_session
msgid "Point of Sale Session"
msgstr "销售点会话"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_pos_access_hr.hr_employee_view_form_pos_access
msgid "Register and Payment"
msgstr "收银机与付款"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_no_cash_move
msgid ""
"The Cash In/Out button of the Point of Sale is hidden, and cash moves sent "
"anyway are refused."
msgstr "销售点的“现金存取”按钮被隐藏，强行发送的现金变动将被拒绝。"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_no_refund
msgid ""
"The Refund button of the Point of Sale is hidden, and refunds sent anyway "
"are refused."
msgstr "销售点的“退款”按钮被隐藏，强行发送的退款将被拒绝。"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_no_discount
msgid ""
"The discount key (%) of the Point of Sale is disabled, and orders sent with "
"a discounted line, or with the global discount, are refused. Refunding a "
"discounted sale stays possible."
msgstr "销售点的折扣键 (%) 被禁用，含折扣行或整单折扣的订单将被拒绝。仍可对打折的销售进行退款。"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_max_discount
msgid "The highest discount that may be given on a line. 0 for no limit."
msgstr "单行可给予的最高折扣。0 表示不限。"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_no_price_change
msgid ""
"The price key of the Point of Sale is disabled, and a price below the one of"
" the pricelist is refused."
msgstr "销售点的价格键被禁用，低于价目表的价格将被拒绝。"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_pos_access_hr.hr_employee_view_form_pos_access
msgid ""
"What this employee may not do in the Point of Sale, when they log in to the shop with their\n"
"                        badge or PIN."
msgstr "此员工使用工牌或 PIN 登录店铺时，在销售点中不能做的事。"

#. module: om_pos_access_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access_hr.field_hr_employee__om_pos_own_rules
msgid ""
"When this employee is the cashier, the rules below apply. Off, they follow "
"the rules of their Odoo user, or else of the Odoo user who opened the shop."
msgstr "当此员工担任收银员时，以下规则适用。关闭时，遵循其 Odoo 用户的规则，否则遵循打开店铺的 Odoo 用户的规则。"
